<title>SPAIN: Spain's Huarte to be listed again.</title>
<headline>Spain's Huarte to be listed again.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Troubled Spanish construction firm Huarte said on Monday it will once again be listed on the Madrid and Barcelona stock exchanges from Wednesday after a five-month suspension.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it expects 1997 profits of about 700 million pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
